[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=23 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="第二天，你在桌上发现一套干衣服、一截新铅笔和一张没有写抬头的餐票。餐票背面写着：锅在右边，别掀左边的盖子，那是颜料。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你昨晚睡着了吗？我听见你在走廊走。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="一闭眼就觉得地板要沉。走一走好一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="头几天都这样。可以开着灯，我睡对门，不嫌亮。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你以为她会问你梦见了什么。她却把自己的碗推过来，问你能不能帮她挑出一片掉进去的漆。生活在这里总是有一点没法郑重的事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="早饭吃完来码头。我们丢了一箱净水膜，仓库给的替代品比你毯子还容易漏。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="去昨天那片海？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="去旧信标外侧的打捞点。不是送你回去，别那个表情。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="原本只做物资回收。昨晚维修班在那边听见断续信号，说有一份旧档案跟净水膜放在一起。旧金山希望我们顺手带回来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="她说“顺手”的时候通常不顺。我查过潮汐，退路有，但得在搜索前留出来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我们能先看看原始记录吗？不是她整理过的那份。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="帕金斯把耳机推过来。信号大部分时候只是噪声，中间有三次短促的敲击。你跟着敲了一遍，手指停在桌边，耳机里却多出第四声。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="怎么了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="可能是回声。我不确定。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="那就把“不确定”也记上。今天还有别的事，别把自己全塞进一段杂音里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="码头边有人正在补网。渔网挂着几个旧瓶盖，颜色跟你们舰上的标记一样。你问拉姆森为什么，她说方便认自己人的东西，丢海里以后也一样。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="能带回来的先带回来。带不下就记位置，别把船也赔进去。小队没有多余的第五条命给你算账。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="不是有五个人吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="所以你算数的时候，把自己也放进去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把这句话写在新铅笔的纸套上。纸太窄，最后一个字只好写到背面。德雷顿看见了，忍住笑，没替你把它说成什么伟大的约定。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

